There is a man here.
His name is Peter.
"Hi, my name is Peter," he says.
"What is your name?" he asks.
"My name is Maya," I say.
"Where do you come from, Maya?" Peter asks.
"I come from a country far away," I say.
"Are you new in Copenhagen?" he asks.
"Yes, I am very new," I say.
"Welcome to the city," Peter says.
"Thank you, Peter," I say.
Peter is friendly. Now he is my friend.
